graph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >选择对应的遥控器</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >在飞行中&nbsp;如果舵面和操控不对。&nbsp;需要调节</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span><img width=3D"1024"  height=3D"768"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-4193.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span><img width=3D"142"  height=3D"43"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-4342.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span><img width=3D"1024"  height=3D"768"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-4491.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span><img width=3D"1024"  height=3D"768"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-4641.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >在对应通道右边</span><span><img width=3D"184"  height=3D"380"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-4797.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >&nbsp;下拉&nbsp;然后通过推动遥控器的摇杆可以判断是否是需要的对应通道。接下来&nbsp;一直点击完成&nbsp;就可以享受飞行了。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; color:rgb(8,0,0); font-weight:bold; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >疑难问题解答</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-weight:bold; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >问：运行游戏出现以下错误提示：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >&nbsp;</span><span><img width=3D"496"  height=3D"187"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-5020.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >答：这是由于操作系统DirectX组件缺失造成的。请运行光盘中的"安装Dircetx9"程序修复。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >问：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span><img width=3D"644"  height=3D"180"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-5222.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >答：1.&nbsp;请确认控制台已经运行，并且已经切换到相应档位在phoenix&nbsp;RC一项。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp;加密狗没有插入电脑或者驱动安装异常，请检查。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >问：遥控器是&#8220;左手/右手&#8221;油门，但是在软件中的操作则相反变成了&#8220;右手/左手&#8221;油门。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >答：在&#8220;系统设置&#62;控制通道设置&#62;编辑您正在使用的配置文件（编辑配置文件）&#8221;里调换2通道和3通道的位置即可</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-weight:bold; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >问：推油门杆，但是飞机引擎没有启动，飞机无法起飞；飞机起落架无法放下/收起；直升机怠速时旋翼转速极高。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >答：拨动遥控手柄左上方和右上方的开关（也即第5通道和第6通道）试试。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-weight:bold; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >问：如何使用第一人称飞行模式和3D地图？</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >答：要使用第一人称模式需要更换3D地图，在更换场地里选择3D地图，然后在查看信息摄像机视角里选择gui_menu。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'宋体'; " >问：运行游戏出现以下错误提示：</span><span><img width=3D"360"  height=3D"170"  src=3D"~tmp1395670398.files/~tmp1395670398-5729.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >答：请检查软件的安装路径中是否有中文。（检查方法：右键单击桌面上本软件的快捷方式，选择&#8220;属性&#8221;。属性面板中的&#8220;起始位置&#8221;一栏即为安装路径）本软件的安装路径必须为英文！请在卸载本软件后选择新路径重装。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-weight:bold; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >小技巧：</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'微软雅黑'; " >如果您不想把软件安装在C盘，比如想装在D盘，那只要把路径里的第一个字母C改成D即可。</span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp0  style=3D"margin-bottom:0pt; margin-top:0pt; text-autospace:ideograph-other; " ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes'; font-size:12.0000pt; font-family:'Times New Roman'; " ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

